        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Spire never ends — until you do. Face relentless waves of monsters and ever-changing floors in this roguelike survival adventure. Each climb is different, each fight more dangerous than the last.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Survive brutal battles, master your skills, and adapt your strategy as you ascend to new heights. Collect powerful upgrades, discover hidden secrets, and push further with every run. The higher you climb, the greater the challenge — and the greater the reward.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Do you have what it takes to conquer the 33rd floor, or will the Spire claim you like all who came before?</i></p>",
